<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BCP posts 1Q results Apr 22.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BCP posts 1Q results Apr 22.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Comercial Portugues (BCP) said it would present its results for the first quarter of 1997 on April 22 at 1800 GMT.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
